  "verseCount": 38,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Phaawulos Maqedooniyaa fi Giriik Dhaqe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phaawulos erga gooliin qabbanaaʼee booddee barattoota waamsisee isaan jajjabeesse; \"Nagaatti\" isaaniin jedhees Maqedooniyaa dhaquuf kaʼe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis dubbii nama jajjabeessu baayʼee uummatatti dubbachaa naannoo sana keessa darbee dhuma irratti Giriik gaʼe;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "achis jiʼa sadii ture. Akkuma inni dooniin Sooriyaa dhaquuf kaʼeenis sababii Yihuudoonni isatti malataniif karaa Maqedooniyaatiin deebiʼuuf kutate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beeriyaadhaa Soophaaxroos ilma Phiiyiroos, Tasaloniiqeedhaa Arisxirokoosii fi Sekunduus, Darbeenii immoo Gaayoos isa wajjin deeman; akkasumas Xiimotewos, biyya Asiyaatii immoo Xikiqoosii fi Xiroofiimoos isa wajjin deeman.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namoonni kunneen nu dura darbanii Xirooʼaasitti nu eegan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayyaana Maxinoo booddee garuu Fiiliphisiyuusii dooniin kaanee bultii shan booddee warra kaan wajjin Xirooʼaasitti wal arganne; achis guyyaa torba turre.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Awuxekiis Duʼaa Kaafame",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nus guyyaa jalqaba torban sanaatti buddeena caccabsuuf jennee walitti qabamne; Phaawulos namootatti haasaʼe. Innis waan guyyaa itti aanutti deemuu barbaadeef hamma halkan walakkaatti haasaa dheeresse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gulantaa darbii iddoo nu itti walitti qabamne keessa ibsaa baayʼeetu ture.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dargaggeessi Awuxekiis jedhamu tokkos foddaa irra taaʼaa ture; yommuu Phaawulos haasaa dheeressettis hirribni cimaan isa fudhate; utuu hirribaan of wallaalee jiruus darbii sadaffaa irraa kufe; isaanis reeffa isaa lafaa fuudhan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phaawulosis gad buʼee dargaggeessa sana irratti gombifamee isa hammachuudhaan, \"Lubbuun keessa jirtiitii hin rifatinaa!\" jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis darbii sanatti ol deebiʼee buddeena caccabsee nyaate; hamma lafti bariituttis yeroo dheeraa isaan wajjin haasaʼe achii deeme.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namoonnis dargaggeessa sana jiraataa taʼee manatti geessan; baayʼees ni jajjabaatan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Phaawulos Jaarsolii Waldaa Kiristaanaa Efesoon Gorse",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nus Phaawulosin achii fuudhuuf jennee duraan dursinee gara doonii dhaqnee dooniidhaan Asoositti qajeelle; Phaawulos miillaan deemuuf jedhee ofuma isaatii waan kana karoorfatee tureetii.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asoosittis isaan wal arginee dooniidhaan Miixiiliinitti dabarre.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyyaa itti aanuttis dooniin achii kaanee fuullee Kiiyos geenye; guyyaa tokko booddees Saamoositti baane; guyyaa itti aanu immoo Miilexoos geenye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phaawulosis yoo dandaʼameef waan guyyaa Pheenxeqoosxeetiin Yerusaalem gaʼuuf ariifateef akka biyya Asiyaa keessatti yeroon isa duraa hin dhumneef jedhee dooniidhaan Efesoon bira darbee deemuu murteeffatee ture.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis Miilexoosii Efesoonitti nama ergee jaarsolii waldaa kiristaanaa ofitti waamsise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaan gara isaa dhufnaan akkana jedheen; \"Ani gaafan biyya Asiyaa dhufe kan duraatii jalqabee yeroon isin wajjin jiraachaa ture sana hunda haala akkam keessa akka ani jiraachaa ture isin mataan keessan iyyuu beektu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani yoon mala Yihuudootaatiin akka malee qorame illee gad of qabiisa guddaa fi imimmaaniin Gooftaa tajaajileera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Utuu waan faayidaa isinii qabu tokko illee lallabuu irraa of hin qusatin akka ani mana tokkoo gara mana kaanii deemee ifatti baasee isin barsiise isinuu beektu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani akka Yihuudoonnii fi Giriikonni qalbii jijjiirrachuudhaan gara Waaqaatti deebiʼanii fi akka isaan Gooftaa keenya Yesuus Kiristoositti amanan isaanitti himeera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Ammas ani utuu waan achitti narra gaʼuuf jiru hin beekin Hafuuraan dirqamee Yerusaalem dhaquuttin jira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hafuurri Qulqulluun immoo akka hidhamuu fi rakkachuun na eeggatu magaalaa hunda keessatti dhugaa naa baʼa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Taʼus ani fiigicha sana xumuruu fi hojii Gooftaa Yesuus natti kenne sana hobbaafachuuf jedhee jireenya koo akka waan faayidaa hin qabneetti nan lakkaaʼa; hojiin kunis wangeela ayyaana Waaqaatiif dhugaa baʼuu dha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Ani akka isin warra ani keessa nanaannaʼee mootummaa Waaqaa lallabe kanneen keessaa namni tokko iyyuu lammata na hin argine nan beeka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanaafuu ani dhiiga nama hundaa irraa qulqulluu taʼuu koo harʼa isinitti nan hima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani fedhii Waaqaa hunda isinitti himuu irraa of hin qusanneetii.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isin of eegaa; karra hoolota Hafuurri Qulqulluun irratti Phaaphaasota isin godhe sanaa hundas eegaa. Waldaa Kiristaanaa Waaqaa kan inni dhiiga ofii isaatiin bitate sanaafis tiksoota taʼaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erga ani deemee booddee akka yeeyyiiwwan hamoon dhufanii gidduu keessan seenan, akka isaan karra hoolotaa sana keessaa tokko illee hin hambifnes ani beeka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isinuma keessaa iyyuu namoonni barattoota of faana fudhachuuf jedhanii dubbii micciiramaa dubbatan ni kaʼu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanaafuu isin of eeggadhaa! Akka ani waggaa sadii halkanii guyyaa utuu gargar hin kutin imimmaaniin tokkoo tokkoo keessan gorsaa ture yaadadhaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Ani amma Waaqatti, akkasumas dubbii ayyaana isaa kan isin ijaaruu dandaʼuu fi kan warra qulqullaaʼan hunda keessatti dhaala isinii kennuu dandaʼu sanatti isinin kennadha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani meetii yookaan warqee yookaan uffata nama tokkoo iyyuu hin kajeelle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akka ani harkuma koo kanaan hojjedhee waan naa fi warra na wajjin jiraniif barbaachisu argamsiise isin mataan keessan iyyuu ni beektu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani waan hojjedhe hunda keessatti nu dubbii Gooftaa Yesuus mataan isaa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "'Fudhachuu irra kennuutu eebba qaba'",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ACT.20.35",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ACT.20.35"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jedhee dubbate sana yaadachaa hojii jabaa akkanaatiin akka warra dadhabaa gargaaruu qabnu isin argisiiseera.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.20.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
